{"sha": "79a36e510f9899e3204121b88fc6249d02fd5d072c599ca0806cd12782197108", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:linmaps} 章 --- 线性映射}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:1}", "（1）线性：坐标是线性表达式。（2）非线性：", "$u(2(1,1)) = 4 \\neq 2 = 2u(1,1)$。（3）线性：求导与", "乘以 $X$ 均为线性，线性映射之和亦然。（4）线性：", "求值与逐点运算相容。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:2}", "核：解方程组 $x + y - z = 0$，$2x + y + z = 0$，$3x + 2y = 0$。", "由第三式得 $y = -\\frac{3x}{2}$；第一式给出 $z = x + y =", "-\\frac x2$；代入第二式验证：$2x - \\frac{3x}{2} - \\frac x2 = 0$，", "成立。故 $\\ker u = \\operatorname{Vect}\\bigl((2, -3, -1)\\bigr)$", "（取 $x = 2$），维数为 $1$。", "", "由秩–零化度定理，$\\operatorname{rk} u = 3 - 1 = 2$。像由", "典范基的像张成：$u(e_1) = (1,2,3)$，$u(e_2) =", "(1,1,2)$，$u(e_3) = (-1,1,0)$；前两个向量线性无关，且秩", "为 $2$，基为 $\\bigl((1,2,3), (1,1,2)\\bigr)$。", "", "不是单射（$\\ker \\neq \\{0\\}$），也不是满射（秩 $2 < 3$）：", "与\\cref{cor:b1:linmaps:samedim}一致。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:3}", "\\emph{核：}$P = P'$ 蕴含 $\\deg P = \\deg P'$，除非 $P = 0$；", "但 $\\deg P' < \\deg P$ 对 $P \\neq 0$ 成立，故 $\\ker u = \\{0\\}$，", "于是 $u$ 作为有限维空间 $\\R_n[X]$ 上的单自同态，是", "同构（\\cref{cor:b1:linmaps:samedim}）。", "", "\\emph{逆：}设 $v(P) = P + P' + P'' + \\dots + P^{(n)}$（在 $\\R_n[X]$ 上的", "有限和）。则", "\\[", "v\\bigl(u(P)\\bigr) = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} (P - P')^{(k)}", "= \\sum_{k=0}^{n} P^{(k)} - \\sum_{k=0}^{n} P^{(k+1)}", "= P - P^{(n+1)} = P ,", "\\]", "裂项相消，因 $P^{(n+1)} = 0$。故 $v = u^{-1}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:4}", "$\\operatorname{im}(v \\circ u) = v(\\operatorname{im} u) \\subseteq", "\\operatorname{im} v$：秩 $\\leq \\operatorname{rk} v$。又 $v$", "限制在 $\\operatorname{im} u$ 上的像为", "$\\operatorname{im}(vu)$，由秩–零化度定理，在", "$\\operatorname{im} u$ 中 $\\operatorname{rk}(vu) \\leq", "\\dim\\operatorname{im} u = \\operatorname{rk} u$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:5}", "$u^2 = 0$ 表示 $u(u(x)) = 0$ 对所有 $x$ 成立：每个 $u(x)$ 都属于", "$\\ker u$，即 $\\operatorname{im} u \\subseteq \\ker u$。于是由", "秩–零化度定理：", "\\[", "\\dim E = \\dim\\ker u + \\operatorname{rk} u \\geq 2\\operatorname{rk} u .", "\\]", "取等情形的例子：在 $\\R^2$ 中取 $u(x, y) = (y, 0)$，则 $u^2 = 0$，", "$\\operatorname{rk} u = 1 = \\frac{\\dim E}{2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:6}", "$(pq)^2 = pqpq = ppqq = pq$（由交换性），即为投影", "（\\cref{thm:b1:linmaps:projchar}）。", "", "像：$\\operatorname{im}(pq) \\subseteq \\operatorname{im} p$，且", "$= \\operatorname{im}(qp) \\subseteq \\operatorname{im} q$：从而包含于", "交集之中。反之，若 $x \\in \\operatorname{im} p \\cap", "\\operatorname{im} q$，则 $p(x) = x$ 且 $q(x) = x$（不动点", "刻画投影的像），故 $pq(x) = x$，即 $x \\in", "\\operatorname{im}(pq)$。", "", "核：$\\ker p \\subseteq \\ker(qp) = \\ker(pq)$，同理 $\\ker q", "\\subseteq \\ker(pq)$，故和包含于其中。反之，设 $pq(x) =", "0$，并写出", "\\[", "x = \\underbrace{q(x)}_{\\in\\, \\ker p} +", "\\underbrace{(x - q(x))}_{\\in\\, \\ker q} :", "\\]", "第一项满足 $p(q(x)) = 0$，故属于 $\\ker p$；", "第二项属于 $\\ker q$，因 $q(x - q(x)) = q(x) - q^2(x) = 0$。由此", "得 $x \\in \\ker p + \\ker q$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:7}", "首先注意一般的包含关系 $\\ker u \\subseteq \\ker u^2$ 与", "$\\operatorname{im} u^2 \\subseteq \\operatorname{im} u$，并由", "秩–零化度定理，（2）$\\iff$ （3）（核相等 $\\iff$ 秩相等", "$\\iff$ 像相等，依上述包含关系）。", "", "（1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2）：设 $u^2(x) = 0$，则 $u(x) \\in \\ker u \\cap", "\\operatorname{im} u = \\{0\\}$，故 $x \\in \\ker u$。", "", "（2 $\\Rightarrow$ 1）：由格拉斯曼公式及秩–零化度定理，$\\dim(\\ker u +", "\\operatorname{im} u) = \\dim\\ker u + \\operatorname{rk} u -", "\\dim(\\ker u \\cap \\operatorname{im} u) = \\dim E - \\dim(\\ker u \\cap", "\\operatorname{im} u)$：和为 $E$ 当且仅当交集为", "$\\{0\\}$。设 $y \\in \\ker u \\cap \\operatorname{im} u$：$y = u(x)$ 且", "$u(y) = 0$，故 $u^2(x) = 0$，由（2）得 $u(x) = 0$：$y = 0$。由此", "得 $E = \\ker u \\oplus \\operatorname{im} u$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:linmaps:8}", "若 $\\varphi = 0$，则 $\\ker\\varphi = E \\subseteq \\ker\\psi$，蕴含", "$\\psi = 0 = 0\\cdot\\varphi$。若 $\\varphi \\neq 0$，则 $\\ker\\varphi$ 是", "超平面；取 $a \\notin \\ker\\varphi$。令 $\\lambda =", "\\frac{\\psi(a)}{\\varphi(a)}$。线性型 $\\psi - \\lambda\\varphi$", "在 $\\ker\\varphi$ 上为零（二者皆然，由包含关系），且在 $a$ 处为零：", "它在 $\\ker\\varphi \\oplus Ka = E$ 上为零。于是 $\\psi =", "\\lambda\\varphi$。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}